          "voice": "library_fishadrian",
          "text": "The path beyond the garden curved between tall trees and disappeared behind a hill. Across the valley the empty station waited beneath a pale and cloudless autumn sky. Its wooden benches held a thin layer of dust from the road outside the fence.",
